{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.LpDualityHypothesisClass","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.LpDualityHypothesisClass","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Basic"],"declarations":15,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HasFiniteLPDuality.theorem_1_via_class","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HasFiniteLPDuality.theorem_1_via_class","kind":"theorem","line":163,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/LpDualityHypothesisClass.lean#L163-L172","doc":"Theorem 1 (Wedderburn maximizer in active set) derived from the\nhypothesis class.  Given the maximizer's tightness assumption\n+ complementary slackness from the class, the maximizer lies in\nthe active set. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HasFiniteLPDuality.theorem_3_via_class","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HasFiniteLPDuality.theorem_3_via_class","kind":"theorem","line":153,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/LpDualityHypothesisClass.lean#L153-L161","doc":"Theorem 3 of `prop:confinement-nf-partial-proof` derived from\nthe hypothesis class.  Drop-in replacement for the existing\n`theorem_3_strong_duality` (which currently uses a `sorry`):\n`theorem_3_via_class` consumes the class instance instead. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HasFiniteLPDuality.complementarySlackness","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HasFiniteLPDuality.complementarySlackness","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/LpDualityHypothesisClass.lean#L91-L91","doc":"Complementary slackness (Schrijver §7.4).  At the optimum,\na partition λ lies in the LP active set iff its primal\nconstraint is tight. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HasFiniteLPDuality.dualityGapZero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HasFiniteLPDuality.dualityGapZero","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/LpDualityHypothesisClass.lean#L87-L87","doc":"Strong duality theorem (Schrijver §7.2).  Bounded + feasible\nfinite LPs satisfy `primal = dual`, hence `duality_gap = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HasFiniteLPDuality.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HasFiniteLPDuality.mk","kind":"ctor","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/LpDualityHypothesisClass.lean#L84-L84","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HasFiniteLPDuality","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HasFiniteLPDuality","kind":"class","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/LpDualityHypothesisClass.lean#L70-L91","doc":"**Finite LP strong-duality + complementary-slackness hypothesis class.**\n\nClass-axiomatises the two routine LP-theory inputs needed to\ndischarge `theorem_3_strong_duality` and\n`theorem_1_maximizer_in_active_set` in\n`confinement-nf-partial-proof.lean` without `sorry`s in the\nconsumer file.  Per AGENTS.md §3b-cond conditional-class\npattern.\n\nClass fields:\n- `dualityGapZero` — `lp.duality_gap = 0` (Schrijver §7.2).\n- `complementarySlackness` — `λ ∈ active_set ↔ tight λ`\n  (Schrijver §7.4). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:lp-duality-hypothesis-class","label":"def:lp-duality-hypothesis-class","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/lp-duality-hypothesis-class.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.OperatorSelectionLP.duality_gap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.OperatorSelectionLP.duality_gap","kind":"def","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/LpDualityHypothesisClass.lean#L64-L66","doc":"Duality gap = |primal − dual|. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.OperatorSelectionLP.tight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.OperatorSelectionLP.tight","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/LpDualityHypothesisClass.lean#L60-L60","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.OperatorSelectionLP.active_set","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.OperatorSelectionLP.active_set","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/LpDualityHypothesisClass.lean#L59-L59","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.OperatorSelectionLP.dual_obj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.OperatorSelectionLP.dual_obj","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/LpDualityHypothesisClass.lean#L58-L58","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.OperatorSelectionLP.primal_obj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.OperatorSelectionLP.primal_obj","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/LpDualityHypothesisClass.lean#L57-L57","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.OperatorSelectionLP.finite","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.OperatorSelectionLP.finite","kind":"theorem","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/LpDualityHypothesisClass.lean#L56-L56","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.OperatorSelectionLP.Λ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.OperatorSelectionLP.Λ","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/LpDualityHypothesisClass.lean#L55-L55","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.OperatorSelectionLP.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.OperatorSelectionLP.mk","kind":"ctor","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/LpDualityHypothesisClass.lean#L54-L54","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.OperatorSelectionLP","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.OperatorSelectionLP","kind":"structure","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/LpDualityHypothesisClass.lean#L50-L60","doc":"Abstract operator-selection LP — mirror of the structure in\n`confinement-nf-partial-proof.lean`, restated locally to avoid\ncross-module imports until that file is refactored to consume this\nclass. ","signatureChunk":0}]}